# Phase 18 compatibility release gate — 2026-10-21 11:16:54 UTC

## Bounded verification correction

The first `cargo test --workspace --locked` run failed in
`query_admin_header_reflection_modes_match_invoked_java_551`: the shared
Remoting differential fixture had newly added Java header cases that its
Rust header-type dispatch did not yet cover. Added fast/reflection decode and
re-encode comparisons for all seven concrete request/response header types:
the Add/Wipe write-permission pairs, RocksDB CQ progress, RocksDB config
export, and master flush offset.

Validation after the correction:

- The targeted Remoting decode-mode test passed.
- `cargo test --workspace --locked` passed, including all workspace unit,
  integration, and doctests (Protocol: 151 doctests; Remoting: 138 unit tests
and 107 transport integration tests).
- `cargo test --workspace --all-features --locked` passed with the same
workspace doctests and all-feature test paths.
- Strict all-target/all-feature locked workspace Clippy passed.
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check` passed.

The correction is committed independently as `da6345bb`
(`test(remoting): cover recent admin header decode modes`). These results
close only this discovered test-dispatch gap. The remaining current-revision
P18-V02 commands, P18-V01 source/API/configuration reconciliation, current
